  {"path": ["Idle"], "idle": true, "lines": [["- Idle 1 \"Sometume Hu get so donedi.'\" Sometime[s] I get so lonely. / Idle 2 \"Grat hultus plake hun kle unhurverse?\" What ??? place in the universe? / Idle 3 \"Hut's so reg tu fe un kle monklenres.\" It's so ??? on the ???.", null], ["- / /", "IdleGrnQueensGrds1.ogg"], ["- Idle 4 \"Gry am Hu regre?\" Why am I here? / Idle 5 \"Onry Hu ras make hut out of klus plake.\" Only I has make it out of this place. / Idle 6 Ahum denslerat kuhuing arounr rer gets tu ke so brorhung! ??? being around her gets to be so boring!", null], ["- / /", "IdleGrnQueensGrds4.ogg"]]},
